+### `GET /v1/known-words` — reading status back ("Flashcard'dan oku")
 
-Not used by the extension yet (`FlashcardsApi.knownWords` exists). Meant to color the subtitles from the app's
-reviews, like "Anki'den oku": a card reviewed at intervals of 21 days or more is a known word, others learning.
+Read by the background when the user presses **Flashcard'dan oku** (Words tab, or the settings page's Öğrenme servisi
+section with Subtitle Kartları picked), like "Anki'den oku": the app decides which words are known (e.g. a card
+reviewed at intervals of 21 days or more) and which learning, and the subtitles color them. `new` words are ignored;
+a word the user marked known in the extension stays known.
+
+The extension asks `GET /v1/me` first: `features.known_words: false` means the app doesn't share the words (the row
+says so and nothing is asked). Each page may also say `"shared": false` (an empty last page), taken the same way. A
+server that says neither is taken to share. Pages are followed by `next_cursor` until it's `null` (at most 200 pages;
+a cursor seen before stops it).
 
